    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cook the broccoli in the same water as the pasta. It saves a pan and adds starch to the cooking water. The broccoli goes in first, then the pasta joins it."
          }
        ]
      },
